<title>USA: Alico Inc Q4 net income, share lower.</title>
<headline>Alico Inc Q4 net income, share lower.</headline>
<dateline>LA BELLE, Fla. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.17		    $0.82</p>
<p> Net		 1,169		    5,754</p>
<p> Revs		4,704		    12,974</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS ENDED AUGUST 31</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.63		    $1.27</p>
<p> Net		 4,400		    8,900</p>
<p> Revs		36,100		   39,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the decrease in net income for the 1996 periods was due to a significant decrease in real estate earnings.</p>
